mediation":"升级 Squid 至 2.4.STABLE4 或更高版本（官方补丁 squid-2.4.STABLE3-ftp_coredump.patch 已修复此漏洞）。如无法立即升级，可在 squid.conf 顶部添加以下 ACL 规则以缓解风险：`acl non_anonymous_ftp url_regex -i ftp://[^/@]*@` 和 `http_access deny non_anonymous_ftp`，拒绝非匿名 FTP URL 的代理转发。同时限制只有受信任用户才允许使用 FTP 代理功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/caldera/2002-q1/0014.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000464","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101431040422095&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101440163111826&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101443252627021&w=2","http://www.caldera.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2002-010.0.txt","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8258.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-016.php","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_008_squid_txt.html","http://www.osvdb.org/5378","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-029.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4148","http://www.squid-cache.org/Versions/v2/2.4/bugs/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21297","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0068.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0068","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0068.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2002/CVE-2002-0068.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0068.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0068.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0068.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0068.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4aa573a753d6387eff023ebcf6fc6297b912048e/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-00xx/CVE-2002-0068.json","https://github.com/tholian-network/vulnerabilities/blob/cd8798a37e6d58633681c9596bee14e4189ad0e9/database/vulnerability/CVE-2002-0068.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0137.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0137.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0136","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0136.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0067","title":"Squid HTCP 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Squid 2.4 STABLE3 及更早版本中存在安全绕过漏洞。即使管理员在 squid.conf 中将 htcp_port 设置为 0 以禁用 HTCP 协议，Squid 实际上并未正确禁用该协议，导致 HTCP 服务仍然处于可用状态。远程攻击者无需认证即可利用此漏洞，通过发送特制的 HTCP 数据包绕过预期的访问控制限制，可能导致信息泄露、权限提升或服务异常。该漏洞影响 Squid 2.4 STABLE3 及之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0067"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-03-08T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:42Z","remediation":"升级 Squid 至 2.4.STABLE4 及以上版本，或应用官方补丁 squid-2.4.STABLE3-htcp_off.patch。如无法升级，重新编译 Squid 时去掉 --enable-htcp 选项以彻底禁用 HTCP 功能；或在防火墙层面阻断 UDP 端口 4827（HTCP 默认端口）的入站流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/caldera/2002-q1/0014.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000464","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101431040422095&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101443252627021&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8261.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-016.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5379","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-029.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4150","http://www.squid-cache.org/Versions/v2/2.4/bugs/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1842f861696b8e0d2a79b27d77e1bfe