2002-0134.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0062","title":"GNU ncurses 缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"ncurses 5.0 及 Red Hat Linux 中使用的 ncurses4 兼容包存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，该漏洞与物理光标移动和滚动相关的例程有关。攻击者利用此漏洞可在本地系统上提升权限，从而以更高权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响使用 ncurses 5.0 及 ncurses4 兼容包的 Red Hat Linux 系统，CVSS 评分为 7.2，属于高危级别。本地攻击者可借助精心构造的输入触发缓冲区溢出，突破权限限制，进而控制受影响的系统。Red Hat 后续发布了安全公告（DSA-113）提供修复信息。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0062"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-03-08T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-23T18:58:25Z","remediation":"升级 ncurses 至 5.2 及以上版本。Red Hat Linux 用户安装 RHSA-2002:039 提供的更新包；Debian 用户安装 DSA-113 提供的 libncurses5 更新包。如无法升级，移除 ncurses4 兼容包（ncurses-compat-libs）的 setuid 权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-113","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8222.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-020.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2116","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b6911473cb9f3b7c6e3bfc931e2219f763048798/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0062.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0062","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/da07cb97146d03883b70ca493bde18a430b683ac/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0062.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9d5b2a1dce9c7e458934cecfd52fe64aaa62e247/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0062.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-113.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-33p7-vhh2-qpvp/GHSA-33p7-vhh2-qpvp.json","https://github.com/emmanuelgjr/genai_incidents/blob/637a318fa16d678464b6eb61c41de2467e83015b/docs/incidents/2002.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0062.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148300_148400.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0134.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0132","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0132.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0060","title":"Linux kernel IRC连接跟踪辅助模块 防火墙绕过漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.4.18-pre9 及更早版本中，netfilter 子系统的 IRC 连接跟踪辅助模块存在安全绕过漏洞。该模块在处理传入的 IRC DCC（直接客户端连接）请求时，未正确设置 conntrack 期望掩码，导致防火墙连接跟踪机制被欺骗。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制的 DCC 数据包，绕过 iptables/netfilter 设定的访问控制规则，访问本应被拦截的网络服务。该漏洞影响所有启用 netfilter 防火墙功能的 Linux 2.4.18-pre9 及更早内核版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0060"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-03-08T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:41Z","remediation":"将Linux内核升级至2.4.18-pre9或更高版本，该版本已修复IRC DCC连接跟踪辅助模块的conntrack元组掩码错误。补丁由Harald Welte提交，修正了ip_conntrack_irc.c中掩码设置，将源IP从任意匹配改为仅匹配实际发起DCC请求的内部IP地址。若无法立即升级内核，可在内核配置中移除CONFIG_IP_NF_TARGET_CONNTACK IRC模块（通过设置CONFIG_IP_NF_TARGET_CONNTACK=n重新编译内核），或在内核运行时卸载ip_conntrack_irc模块（执行rmmod ip_conntrack_irc），以彻底消除攻击面。同时检查防火墙规则，避免使用\"-m state --state RELATED -j ACCEPT\"这种 overly permissive的规则，改为针对特定端口的精确放行策略。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:041","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101483396412051&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=vuln-dev&m=101486352429653&w=2","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/230307","http://www.netfilter.org/security/2002-02-25-irc-dcc-mask.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-028.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4188","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX0203-027","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/8302","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc838d0e5ff34a3026c5292897b23b79aee8bacf/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0060.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0060","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0060.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0f7d9238ba77f900663100d40113352eb3a480d7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0060.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7cm4-rxww-3v3q/GHSA-7cm4-rxww-3v3q.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0060.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cf6426fe-3737-4803-a878-5dc38af6bbb3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0060.json","https://github.com/shamedgh/confine/blob/a75dad3ad336e6258a42cd1ce4af061eea68ed76/cve.files/cveToFile.json.type.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0132.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0130","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0130.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0048","title":"rsync rsync I/O符号错误远程代码执行漏洞","description":"rsync 2.4.6、2.3.2 及更早版本的 I/O 函数中存在有符号数与无符号数混合使用的符号错误漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向 rsync 客户端或服务器发送特制数据，触发符号错误导致缓冲区溢出，进而造成拒绝服务或在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响范围广泛，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0048"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-02-27T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:39Z","remediation":"立即将 rsync 升级至 2.5.1 或更高版本。各发行版操作：Debian 用户运行 apt-get upgrade rsync 安装 DSA-106 提供的更新包；Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2002-018 提供的更新 RPM；FreeBSD 用户通过 ports 升级 net/rsync 或安装 FreeBSD-SA-02:10 补丁；SuSE 用户安装 SUSE Security Announcement 2002:Jan:0003 提供的更新。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙限制对 rsync 服务端口（默认 873/TCP）的访问，仅允许可信来源连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000458","http://lists.suse.com/archives/suse-security-announce/2002-Jan/0003.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101223214906963&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101223603321315&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/3839","http://www.caldera.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2002-003.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-106","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7993.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/800635","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-009.php","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1853.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-018.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3958","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/399","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0048.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/b6e8cb5bd39fed494b7be90b0ffddcadd3893758/2002/CVE-2002-0048.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e42829e595f1a9b61ce455f2ab870c6325fb1ad/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0048.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0048","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0048.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0048.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0048.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2002/CVE-2002-0048.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0048.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/050a55b80525b99be98f5c84fe46fa8ac25be676/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0048.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0130.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0113","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0113.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0004","title":"GNU AT 计划任务工具本地堆溢出漏洞","description":"AT 计划任务调度程序 3.1.8 版本存在堆内存破坏漏洞。当用户通过 `at` 命令提交定时任务时，程序对畸形格式的执行时间参数处理不当，导致同一堆内存区域被重复释放（double-free），进而引发堆内存损坏。本地攻击者可通过构造特制的时间字符串触发该漏洞，实现权限提升并以目标用户身份执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Linux/Unix 系统下的 AT 程序，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0004"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-02-27T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:34Z","remediation":"立即升级 at 软件包至修复版本：Debian 2.2 (potato) 升级至 >=3.1.8-6.1，Debian 2.3 (woody) 升级至 >=3.1.8-9。执行 `apt-get update && apt-get upgrade at` 完成更新。如无法升级，可移除 at 的 setuid 位（`chmod u-s /usr/bin/at`）以消除本地提权风险，但会影响普通用户使用 at 命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101128661602088&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101147632721031&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/3833","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/3969","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-102","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_003_at_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-015.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3886","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7909","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21229","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1842f861696b8e0d2a79b27d77e1bfea36333d86/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0004.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0004","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/da07cb97146d03883b70ca493bde18a430b683ac/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0004.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hv62-hp8h-9vjg/GHSA-hv62-hp8h-9vjg.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-102.nasl","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9d5b2a1dce9c7e458934cecfd52fe64aaa62e247/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0004.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0004.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/anonymous-55443259/CVE_Vul_File_Localization/blob/24756649f99ff5cea566f1e66a7fdd2ed0e7aced/Result/repository/repository_collection/repo_from_gpt/result/CVE-2002-0004/3.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2002/dsa-102.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0113.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0112","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0112.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0003","title":"GNU groff 预处理器缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"groff 1.16 及更早版本的预处理器中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过 LPRng 打印系统中的 lpd 服务利用该漏洞获取提升权限。该漏洞源于 groff 预处理器对输入数据缺乏边界检查，攻击者可通过发送精心构造的打印作业触发缓冲区溢出，进而执行任意代码并提升权限。该漏洞影响 groff 1.16 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需认证，影响机密性、完整性和可用性。攻击者需能访问 LPRng 打印服务（通常端口 515），通过提交恶意打印任务触发溢出实现提权。建议升级至 groff 1.17 或更高版本，或禁用不必要的 lpd 服务。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0003"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-02-27T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:34Z","remediation":"升级到 groff 1.20 或更高版本，该版本修复了 CVE-2002-0003 的缓冲区溢出漏洞。对于 LPRng 打印系统，请确保使用集成了安全补丁的最新版本（如 1.23 以上）并重新配置预处理器以禁用不安全的输入处理模式。如无法立即升级，可通过 iptables 阻止对 lpd 端口的特定输入或临时替换 preproc 命令文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/3793","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-012.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-004.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3869","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7881","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0003.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0003","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0003.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/86ec648b067e7f3c439a59ccb9e6e448f07cc2d1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0003.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ba518c3d2e41cb46015251f8c5b067b05ea0ba59/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fvq6-6pr8-jc4x/GHSA-fvq6-6pr8-jc4x.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-012.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0003.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0003.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148200_148300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0112.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0110","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0110.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0001","title":"Mutt Mutt 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mutt 邮件客户端 RFC822 地址解析器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过发送包含不当终止注释或短语的地址列表触发缓冲区溢出，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Mutt 1.2.5.1 之前版本及 1.3.x 分支中 1.3.25 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证，可导致机密性、完整性、可用性均受影响。攻击者只需发送精心构造的邮件地址列表即可触发漏洞，无需用户交互即可在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意命令。Mutt 已在 1.2.5.1 和 1.3.25 版本中修复该漏洞，用户应升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0001"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-02-27T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:34Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 mutt 至 1.2.5.1 版本或 1.3.25 及以上版本（通过包管理器执行 `apt-get upgrade mutt` 或 `yum update mutt` 等）。若无法立即升级，可临时在 mailcap 配置中禁用自动解析 RFC822 地址列表功能，或在防火墙层面限制非信任来源的邮件连接作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000449","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100994648918287&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/3778","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-096","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7759.php","http://www.mutt.org/announce/mutt-1.2.5.1-1.3.25.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_001_mutt_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-003.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3774","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0001.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0001","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0001.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0001.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-096.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bf2e2ab4687e3840d3ae537224ca3dbe9e3c1067/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-w4gg-mg7c-qmxp/GHSA-w4gg-mg7c-qmxp.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0001.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_800_900.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--bbe78ccd-e571-4991-a131-26dfdec3a5b4.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0110.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0121","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0121.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0013","title":"Cisco IOS SNMPv1 请求处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SNMPv1 协议实现中存在严重的请求处理漏洞，远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 GetRequest、GetNextRequest 或 SetRequest SNMP 消息触发该漏洞，导致目标系统拒绝服务或获取完全控制权限。该漏洞影响大量厂商的 SNMP 实现，包括 Cisco IOS 11/12 等广泛部署的网络设备，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。芬兰 Oulu 大学开发的 PROTOS c06-SNMPv1 测试套件已公开验证该漏洞的存在。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0013"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-02-13T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:35Z","remediation":"建议将 Cisco IOS 升级至 12.0(22)S、12.1(13)E 或 12.2(8)T 及更高版本（具体版本视平台而定），或安装 Cisco 于 2002 年 2 月发布的 SNMP 安全补丁。如无法立即升级，可在网络边界防火墙过滤 UDP 端口 161 和 162 以阻断外部 SNMP 流量，同时配置 ACL 限制 SNMP 仅允许受信任的管理站 IP 访问，并修改默认 SNMP community 字符串（public/private）为复杂随机值。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-57404-1","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-03.html","http://www.ee.oulu.fi/research/ouspg/protos/testing/c06/snmpv1/index.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/alerts/advise110.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/854306","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-163.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securi