，影响大量厂商的 SNMP 实现，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。由于 SNMP 协议广泛应用于网络设备管理，攻击者可利用此漏洞完全控制受影响设备。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0012"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-02-13T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:35Z","remediation":"立即联系设备厂商获取 SNMPv1 协议栈安全补丁并升级。如 Cisco 设备请升级至修复 SNMP 畸形消息的 IOS 版本，Compaq Tru64 UNIX 用户安装对应 ERP 补丁包。临时缓解措施：在边界防火墙上过滤 UDP 端口 161 和 162 的入站流量；如业务允许，直接禁用 SNMPv1 服务或升级至 SNMPv3；修改所有设备的默认 SNMP 团体字符串（public/private）；将 SNMP 管理流量隔离到独立管理 VLAN 或 VPN 中。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-03.html","http://www.ee.oulu.fi/research/ouspg/protos/testing/c06/snmpv1/index.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/alerts/advise110.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/107186","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-163.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/4211","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5043","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-006","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1048","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A144","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A161","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A298","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0012.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0012.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0012","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2002.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68711f4b9de04c730603adbbe0fe7b126b6784b4/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0012.json","https://github.com